+-- stone. A fitted pale bodice under a gold sun collar, carved fold ridges and a
+-- faded terracotta stole; a gold sun sash knotted at the right hip, stepping in
+-- from the wide flared hip drape below it; a small bustle behind; and a full
+-- skirt whose panels hang from each thigh, tilt outward and meet at the centre.
+-- A gold seam runs on down the front into the hem (GrashanveilHem).
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
+local Kit = require("./Kit")
+
+-- The Grashan palette: pale ruin stone, sun gold, faded terracotta.
